      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama angambira n'eiraka lihango ati, “Inywe abali b'okubonabonyia ekigo, mwilire haihi buli omoi aije akwete ekikwato ky'okwisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi haija abashaija mukaga, baletwa muhanda gw'ekihigi ekya bunyaruguru, ekilebire bikara, buli muntu akwete ekikwato ky'okwisa, baina omushaija ajwete kitani, aina eihembe ly'abahandiki aha rubaju lilimu obwino. Bataha Rwensinga, bemelera aha rubaju rwa alutare y'omulinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashanga Ruhanga omu kitinwakye yarugire aha bakerubi, mbali yasingiraga, yagobire aha kishasi kya Rwensinga. Ayeta omushaija ayabaire ajwete kitani, ayabaire aina eihembe ly'abahandiki, lilimu obwino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amugambira ati, “Orabe omu kigo kya Yerusalemu, ote akamanyiso aha buso bw'abantu abalikwikya ebikohe nibataga aha rw'amahano agalikukolerwamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abandi omukaga abagambira ati, “Nainywe mumuhondere, murabe omu kigo, mwite abantu. Mutagira womwanagira lisho lya buganyizi, mutashasira muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagurusi mubaite mubamareho, n'abasigazi, n'abaisiki, obwana n'abakazi. Kyonkai ow'akamanyiso mutamukwataho. Mubandize ahali Rwensinga yange.” Kityo babandiza aha bagurusi ababaire bali omu maisho ga Rwensinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija abo omukaga ashuba abagambira ati, “Muhagaze Rwensinga, na nyakabuga zayo muzijuze abafu. Iroko mugende.” Kityo bakwata omuhanda bagenda, baita abantu omu kigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire nibaita abantu abo, inye aho nsigaire nyenkai, ngwa ahansi njumaire nchura, ngira nti, “Waitu Ruhanga, Mukama! Wanigalira Yerusalemu wagibonabonyia kumaraho Abaisiraeli bona abasigaireho?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene Omukama yangambira ati, “Entambara y'eihanga lya Isiraeli n'oruganda rwa Yuda mpango muno, baita abantu omu nsi babamaramu, Yerusalemu omu kigo okutakoza mazima nikwo kwijwiremu, enshonga nibagira bati, ‘Omukama ensi yaitu agihoiremu, kandi talikutubona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanye omu bwange tindibaanagira lisho lya buganyizi, tindibashasira. Ndabaabonabonyia mbature ebyo balikukora; ebyo balikukolera abandi bibashubeho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
